WEBVTT

00:01.540 --> 00:05.060
C'mon, Your Highness, let's go back...

00:05.060 --> 00:07.060
Ya dumb or somethin'?

00:07.060 --> 00:08.990
I don't wanna keep Maria waiting!

00:08.990 --> 00:12.400
This isn't gonna work. 
She has to be asleep by now.

00:12.400 --> 00:18.470
That's why I went out of <i>my</i> way to special 
order <i>ma</i>carons from <i>Ma</i>ria's favorite shop!

00:18.470 --> 00:20.040
Right.

00:20.460 --> 00:24.170
When I deliver these to her 
on this romantic moonlit night,

00:24.170 --> 00:27.190
she'll be so happy, she'll just melt!

00:27.190 --> 00:31.830
Then she'll invite me into her room 
with a smile, and after that...

00:32.560 --> 00:35.180
It's such a perfect plan, 
I can hardly believe myself!

00:35.930 --> 00:39.900
But it's stormy outside. 
Plus, what if we get caught?

00:39.900 --> 00:41.870
This time, they're gonna lock us up!

00:41.870 --> 00:45.440
Aw, just relax! 
There's nobody around anyway.

00:50.660 --> 00:51.930
A ghost...

00:51.930 --> 00:53.490
Wha?!

00:53.490 --> 00:56.580
One could appear, couldn't it? A ghost?

00:57.680 --> 01:01.110
W-We're not gonna see any ghosts! 
All we're gonna see is Maria!

01:01.110 --> 01:03.420
Make sure the macarons are okay.

01:03.930 --> 01:04.980
What?

01:04.980 --> 01:07.350
I can't go giving her any broken ones!

01:07.610 --> 01:10.480
Aww, this whole thing is such a pain.

01:13.760 --> 01:16.140
Why don't we just go back
and eat them ourselves?

01:18.470 --> 01:21.660
Hey, man! What the heck 
you think you're doin'?!

01:22.170 --> 01:25.810
Huh? What is it? You're not gonna fool me.

01:26.400 --> 01:27.180
Huh?

01:27.180 --> 01:29.500
Your Highness, behind you! Behind you!

01:34.000 --> 01:34.870
Huh?

01:34.870 --> 01:36.290
Quick, get outta my way!

01:36.290 --> 01:38.620
Wait! Your Highness!

01:38.620 --> 01:40.830
Oh, ouch!

01:40.830 --> 01:42.380
Ow, ow!

01:42.810 --> 01:43.870
Huh?

01:43.870 --> 01:47.610
Hey, may I have one of those...

01:47.610 --> 01:50.210
macarons...

01:50.210 --> 01:52.590
pleeease?

03:37.070 --> 03:40.160
A white face... Macarons...

03:40.620 --> 03:43.920
Ah, Prince Louis is done for!

03:43.920 --> 03:46.020
He's been like this ever since we found him.

03:46.020 --> 03:48.420
Do you think Prince Louis is safe?

03:48.910 --> 03:49.830
Hmm...

03:49.830 --> 03:54.170
I don't know. But piecing together 
what Lyle has managed to tell us,

03:54.500 --> 03:56.970
it sounds like he was abducted by a ghost.

03:56.970 --> 03:58.320
A ghost?!

03:58.680 --> 04:00.020
Don't act so excited.

04:00.020 --> 04:02.170
I've always wanted to catch one!

04:02.170 --> 04:03.940
And would you do with it?

04:03.940 --> 04:05.000
Keep it as a pet!

04:05.000 --> 04:06.670
You absolutely cannot!

04:06.670 --> 04:08.760
Huh? Why not?

04:08.760 --> 04:11.940
All this on the night I stay at the castle...

04:11.940 --> 04:15.690
But come on. A ghost?
 Not even kids believe in such nonsense.

04:18.110 --> 04:19.400
Scared, are you?

04:19.400 --> 04:20.770
N-Not at all!

04:20.770 --> 04:21.980
Quit hamming it up.

04:23.830 --> 04:26.950
Nonetheless, it's true the prince is missing.

04:27.210 --> 04:29.530
Let's go searching for him, Your Highness.

04:29.530 --> 04:31.710
I'm so very worried about Prince Louis!

04:32.120 --> 04:34.020
You're only in it for the ghost.

04:34.020 --> 04:35.340
Goodness gracious.

04:35.340 --> 04:36.820
Oh, don't say that!

04:36.820 --> 04:38.830
You can't conceal your excitement, missus.

04:38.830 --> 04:39.920
Lettie.

04:41.000 --> 04:42.720
The white ghost...

04:46.100 --> 04:47.210
Must've been around here.

04:47.210 --> 04:49.180
Surely this is all a misunderstanding.

04:49.180 --> 04:54.840
Come morning, he'll show up saying, 
"Hey, whatcha doin' guys?" Just like always.

04:56.020 --> 04:57.750
Prince Louis...

04:58.940 --> 05:00.350
Lyle...

05:00.760 --> 05:04.050
Lyle, everything will be all right.

05:08.840 --> 05:09.600
A g—

05:09.600 --> 05:11.000
A gh-gh-gh-gh-gh...

05:11.000 --> 05:12.040
Gho-ho-ho-ho-ho...

05:12.400 --> 05:15.540
Something probably just fell over. 
Keep your voice down.

05:16.510 --> 05:18.690
I'll take this one and search the lower floors.

05:18.690 --> 05:19.550
What?

05:19.550 --> 05:23.020
All right. If anything happens, 
let's regroup in Lettie's room.

05:23.620 --> 05:26.370
You two be careful, then. Let's get going.

05:26.370 --> 05:29.590
Hold on! I never said I'd go with you!

05:28.350 --> 05:29.590
You don't have veto rights.

05:29.590 --> 05:31.520
Aww!

05:32.060 --> 05:33.550
We should search the upper floors.

05:33.550 --> 05:34.810
You're right.

05:34.810 --> 05:37.910
Maria, take Lyle and wait in my room.

05:37.910 --> 05:39.800
We should let him rest for now.

05:39.800 --> 05:41.240
Yes, missus.

05:42.240 --> 05:45.370
If there's a ghost, I'll catch it 
and show it to you later!

05:45.370 --> 05:46.750
That won't be necessary.

05:48.020 --> 05:52.750
A girl wanders the castle, the pitter-patter
of her bare feet audible against the floor.

05:53.310 --> 05:57.270
If you call out to her, she doesn't answer. 
If you chase her, you can never reach her.

05:57.270 --> 06:02.310
I tried to grab ahold of her with this 
very hand, but I couldn't even touch her!

06:02.760 --> 06:04.630
Whoa...

06:04.630 --> 06:07.720
Wait, so ghosts have feet?

06:07.720 --> 06:08.980
That's a good question.

06:09.440 --> 06:12.590
Come to think of it, there are other 
stories of nobles going missing.

06:12.590 --> 06:13.560
Oh?

06:14.150 --> 06:18.630
When I was a child, I was told 
 never to walk around alone at night,

06:18.630 --> 06:23.280
and that if I ever broke that rule, Death 
would come for my head, dressed all in black.

06:24.440 --> 06:28.410
After hearing that, I developed a high fever 
that lasted for three days and nights.

06:28.820 --> 06:30.830
That's awful.

06:31.240 --> 06:34.330
They say some of the missing 
nobles were never found.

06:36.000 --> 06:38.340
We need to hurry up and find Prince Louis.

06:38.650 --> 06:41.160
He must be terrified all by himself.

06:41.160 --> 06:42.210
You're right.

06:48.430 --> 06:51.300
Prince Louis, are you here?

06:51.300 --> 06:53.020
This all looks very old.

06:53.020 --> 06:55.210
What even is this room?

06:55.210 --> 06:56.980
It's giving me the creeps.

07:01.190 --> 07:01.860
Oh!

07:06.630 --> 07:08.060
What are you doing?

07:08.060 --> 07:10.100
Is that really what you ought to catch?

07:10.100 --> 07:12.080
Never mind that! I saw something!

07:12.080 --> 07:12.890
Huh?

07:12.890 --> 07:15.040
There's totally something on the other side!

07:15.040 --> 07:16.250
Go and look.

07:16.250 --> 07:17.250
Huh?

07:20.350 --> 07:23.610
Sheesh. I'm sure you're just seeing things.

07:23.610 --> 07:26.010
Would you get a move on?

07:26.940 --> 07:28.210
Huh?

07:28.210 --> 07:30.300
I hear something weird!

07:30.770 --> 07:32.510
Keep it down over there.

07:52.040 --> 07:53.450
Prince Clarke!

07:53.450 --> 07:54.830
What's the matter?

07:54.830 --> 07:57.370
There's someone in the garden!

07:57.370 --> 07:58.580
Huh?

07:59.500 --> 08:00.710
I don't see anyone.

08:01.080 --> 08:04.610
Really? But I'm sure I saw a dark figure.

08:04.610 --> 08:06.010
A dark figure?

08:06.010 --> 08:09.190
Lettie, I'm getting a bad feeling. 
Let us proceed with caution.

08:09.190 --> 08:10.260
All right.

08:14.840 --> 08:17.260
Well? Did you find anything?

08:18.140 --> 08:22.190
It was just your imagination. 
Start looking on your side too.

08:22.190 --> 08:23.940
I refuse!

08:23.940 --> 08:27.650
Boy, once I get my hands on that 
stupid prince, he's gonna regret this.

08:31.340 --> 08:32.320
Hmm?

08:33.060 --> 08:34.160
I was just...

08:35.300 --> 08:36.900
Huh? What is it?

08:36.900 --> 08:37.800
Be quiet!

08:38.830 --> 08:41.210
Stop it! You're scaring me!

08:52.590 --> 08:54.150
Ah...

08:57.220 --> 08:59.360
What is it? What happened?!

09:44.080 --> 09:47.280
This is horrible. I must go!

09:59.290 --> 10:00.250
Huh?

10:00.250 --> 10:03.120
Ugh! There's no turning back now!

10:03.920 --> 10:04.640
Hmm?

10:09.050 --> 10:10.090
Huwhat?!

10:26.380 --> 10:27.460
Oh no!

10:29.020 --> 10:30.980
Good evening!

10:30.980 --> 10:32.570
Duke Neil?

10:32.570 --> 10:35.430
Missus, I didn't know you were here!

10:35.430 --> 10:36.990
Maria? What's going on?

10:36.990 --> 10:40.040
You might like to know I had a dream.

10:40.630 --> 10:41.820
A dream?

10:43.290 --> 10:46.190
This is the place. I saw it in my dream.

10:46.750 --> 10:49.840
So is Prince Louis at the end 
of this spiral staircase?

10:49.840 --> 10:51.540
That much, I do not know.

10:51.540 --> 10:55.220
However, I believe there is some 
meaning to the milou's message.

10:55.220 --> 10:56.580
The milou?

10:56.580 --> 11:01.170
His Grace is able to commune 
with the soul of the milou.

11:01.170 --> 11:02.410
Wuh?

11:02.410 --> 11:03.730
Let's go and see.

11:07.050 --> 11:09.610
I'll hang it back up later.

11:17.240 --> 11:18.400
What's the matter?

11:19.920 --> 11:21.970
We should split into two groups.

11:35.150 --> 11:37.690
I never knew the castle 
had passages like this.

11:37.690 --> 11:39.180
Neither did I.

11:39.180 --> 11:40.900
You didn't?

11:40.900 --> 11:41.810
Nope.

11:41.810 --> 11:44.190
The royal family doesn't tend
to the servants' quarters.

11:44.540 --> 11:45.540
What was that?

11:45.540 --> 11:46.810
It's Maria!

11:51.900 --> 11:54.400
Please help!

12:07.120 --> 12:08.320
Maria!

12:08.710 --> 12:09.850
Maria!

12:12.630 --> 12:14.860
I'm quite certain this is Maria's boot.

12:14.860 --> 12:15.920
That would mean—

12:16.300 --> 12:18.170
It's Duke Neil! Let's go!

12:18.170 --> 12:19.200
All right!

12:24.220 --> 12:26.400
Please desist! Come no closer!

12:40.660 --> 12:43.230
Your Grace! Are you over here?!

12:51.450 --> 12:53.210
This is Duke Neil's cane.

12:53.210 --> 12:55.720
Then he must have come this way.

12:59.200 --> 13:01.470
Here! I can feel a faint 
draft blowing through.

13:01.470 --> 13:05.600
I'm not surprised. Finding secret doors 
seems to be a breeze for you.

13:05.850 --> 13:07.550
Oh, it's nothing special.

13:08.350 --> 13:12.670
Please don't move, okay? 
There could be traps placed anywhere.

13:12.670 --> 13:13.560
I'll be fine.

13:15.020 --> 13:17.070
Oh. Lettie.

13:17.070 --> 13:18.070
Wuh?

13:18.070 --> 13:19.360
I think I messed up.

13:19.900 --> 13:23.750
Huh? D-Don't budge, Your Highness! 
I'm coming to get you!

13:32.380 --> 13:34.570
Lettie! Stay back!

13:42.500 --> 13:45.080
Oh no! Prince Clarke!

13:49.390 --> 13:52.940
No! This can't be happening! No!

13:52.940 --> 13:53.600
Oh...

13:54.700 --> 13:56.150
This is it.

14:04.510 --> 14:05.320
Wuh?

14:08.480 --> 14:10.750
You tryin' to start somethin'?!

14:10.750 --> 14:15.320
You underestimate me. 
I'm actually very good at spotting traps!

14:51.610 --> 14:54.120
It's practically inviting me to push it.

14:57.470 --> 15:01.130
This damn thing!

15:10.030 --> 15:11.140
Uh, wuh?

15:11.140 --> 15:13.350
Come on! Start working!

15:14.910 --> 15:15.630
Huh?

15:16.190 --> 15:22.230
No!

15:29.500 --> 15:33.960
Ghost! I know you're there. Show yourself!

15:33.960 --> 15:35.730
Give everyone back!

15:36.540 --> 15:40.340
Bring my Prince Clarke back to me!

15:45.110 --> 15:47.380
Stop! Stay away!

15:46.730 --> 15:47.900
Leticia.

15:47.380 --> 15:50.850
I promise I won't make you my pet!

15:49.160 --> 15:51.950
Leticia, it's me. Brianna.

15:52.220 --> 15:53.160
Wuh?

15:54.270 --> 15:56.110
Bwuh?!

15:56.110 --> 15:57.390
Could you not?

15:57.850 --> 15:59.540
You were okay?

15:59.540 --> 16:00.610
More or less.

16:00.990 --> 16:02.110
Where are we?

16:02.110 --> 16:03.100
Welcome!

16:03.100 --> 16:04.110
Your Majesty?

16:04.400 --> 16:08.050
It's my dear Lettie! You came as well?

16:09.910 --> 16:12.550
You sounded so cool just now!

16:12.550 --> 16:13.410
Wuh?

16:13.410 --> 16:17.220
"Give everyone back! 
Bring my Prince Clarke back to me!"

16:17.220 --> 16:19.800
Ah, I'm so embarrassed!

16:20.760 --> 16:22.720
There's nothing to be embarrassed about.

16:23.290 --> 16:26.060
Hi. Your very own Clarke, Lettie.

16:27.240 --> 16:30.110
I'm glad to see you're unharmed,
 Your Highness.

16:30.110 --> 16:31.430
You too, Maria!

16:31.430 --> 16:34.310
Mm-hmm. Oh, what?

16:32.860 --> 16:34.310
Missus?

16:34.310 --> 16:36.140
I have something to give you.

16:36.640 --> 16:37.690
I see.

16:38.430 --> 16:40.810
Okay... here!

16:40.810 --> 16:42.720
I figured you'd want it back.

16:43.270 --> 16:45.830
Thank you very much, missus.

16:46.320 --> 16:53.410
Ah, the exquisite pull of gravity on my body,
pleasantly stretching my muscles!

16:53.410 --> 16:57.750
On top of that, the stiffness
 I've suffered in my back for years

16:57.750 --> 16:59.410
is finally disappearing!

16:59.410 --> 17:02.150
Ah, what bliss!

17:02.620 --> 17:06.060
Your Grace, I'll leave your cane right here.

17:06.920 --> 17:08.380
Absolutely splendid.

17:08.380 --> 17:11.110
All you do is place slices 
of this vegetable over your eyelids,

17:11.110 --> 17:12.680
and it's incredibly soothing.

17:12.680 --> 17:14.460
You should try it as well.

17:15.060 --> 17:17.110
Try what exactly, Brother?

17:17.110 --> 17:18.270
Beauty care.

17:18.590 --> 17:21.630
Queen Laura's research into it 
is truly advanced.

17:21.630 --> 17:22.510
Hmm?

17:22.510 --> 17:24.080
Ah!

17:25.070 --> 17:27.550
I've never felt so whole before.

17:28.150 --> 17:31.110
He says it cured his chronic back pain.

17:31.110 --> 17:35.000
That is a relief to hear. 
It always gave him such trouble.

17:35.000 --> 17:37.430
That's beside the point! 
What's up with this room?

17:37.430 --> 17:39.010
Don't ask me.

17:39.010 --> 17:43.320
The sealed areas and the servants' quarters
 are connected by hidden passageways.

17:43.320 --> 17:47.140
Those who get caught 
by the traps fall in here.

17:47.140 --> 17:51.100
I've taken over this room and, very secretly,

17:51.100 --> 17:54.590
remodeled it to be my own personal salon.

17:54.590 --> 17:56.140
Yes, I can see that.

17:56.140 --> 17:58.250
I think it's just wonderful!

18:03.690 --> 18:08.810
Oh, Maria! Oh, my Maria! Eeheehee!

18:10.880 --> 18:14.950
Skin all super silky, body smooth head to toe!

18:14.950 --> 18:17.950
Maria, she's the one!

18:19.330 --> 18:22.580
I regret everything! We went 
through so much for this idiot!

18:22.890 --> 18:24.060
Lettie...

18:24.060 --> 18:25.290
Missus...

18:25.290 --> 18:27.790
I am oh-so sorry to have troubled you.

18:27.790 --> 18:31.640
The macarons just looked so delicious, 
I couldn't help saying something to them.

18:31.640 --> 18:35.270
But then little Louis got 
caught in one of the traps.

18:35.270 --> 18:38.650
Mother, isn't it about time we 
dismantled these dangerous contraptions?

18:38.650 --> 18:41.400
Well, just leave this room as-is, okay?

18:41.400 --> 18:42.340
All right.

18:42.340 --> 18:46.690
Oh! Prince Clarke, what about 
the dark figure I saw?

18:46.690 --> 18:47.610
Huh?

18:47.610 --> 18:50.450
If the white ghost was Her Majesty, 
then what was <i>that</i>?

18:50.450 --> 18:53.000
Don't tell me it was the real deal!

18:53.000 --> 18:56.380
I can't be sure, but I know 
I saw <i>something</i>. A dark figure!

19:11.830 --> 19:13.020
The ghost from the garden!

19:13.020 --> 19:13.740
Come for our heads!

19:13.740 --> 19:14.470
Oh dear!

19:14.470 --> 19:15.940
No way, no way! Please no!

19:15.940 --> 19:17.880
I am prepared to fight!

19:19.560 --> 19:20.680
It is I.

19:21.040 --> 19:22.140
Wait, wuh?

19:22.140 --> 19:26.460
Pray tell, what are you all doing making 
such a clamor in the middle of the night?

19:26.460 --> 19:27.650
Lily?

19:28.400 --> 19:31.390
Preoccupied with my first visit 
to the castle in a spell,

19:31.390 --> 19:34.860
I saw some kind of light and 
decided to come and investigate.

19:34.860 --> 19:38.690
I saw it was my lady, and presumed she'd 
given into bad habits and escaped again.

19:38.690 --> 19:42.610
When I signaled for her to return, 
I saw that Prince Clarke was with her

19:42.610 --> 19:45.810
and realized the situation was dire, 
so I became very, very worried.

19:45.810 --> 19:50.280
I rushed to where they were, my heart
 nearly bursting from my chest...

19:51.270 --> 19:53.050
then fell into a trap and wound up here.

19:53.050 --> 19:55.750
Lily! I've missed you so much!

19:55.750 --> 19:58.800
Yes, of course. 
I have missed you too, my lady.

19:59.470 --> 20:01.550
But what are you doing here anyway?

20:01.550 --> 20:05.870
Starting today, I have the pleasure
 of working in your service again.

20:05.870 --> 20:08.230
Huh? Nobody told me.

20:08.230 --> 20:11.040
Brother! What is this all about?

20:11.040 --> 20:12.370
I had no obligation to tell y—

20:12.370 --> 20:13.220
What?!

20:13.220 --> 20:14.090
Hey!

20:15.020 --> 20:16.740
My lady...

20:16.740 --> 20:19.040
I'm glad you've returned, Lily!

20:19.040 --> 20:21.930
I am very pleased to see you well, 
Lady Brianna.

20:21.930 --> 20:26.750
Miss Lily, my name is Maria. 
I have heard a great deal about you.

20:24.820 --> 20:26.750
Oof.

20:26.750 --> 20:29.940
It must have been very difficult 
for you to care for the lady alone.

20:29.940 --> 20:31.790
Please don't hesitate to ask for my help.

20:31.790 --> 20:35.450
Oh, how reassuring! I very much 
look forward to working with you.

20:35.450 --> 20:39.630
Hey, shaddap, you guys! 
How'm I suppose to relax like this?

20:39.630 --> 20:40.910
Huh?!

20:40.910 --> 20:45.170
Prince Louis, you little brat! 
Do you realize how worried we were about you?

20:45.170 --> 20:46.030
Lady Brianna...

20:46.030 --> 20:47.050
Don't try to stop me!

20:47.050 --> 20:48.830
Not at all. I would like to assist.

20:48.830 --> 20:51.290
Listen up, you! It's your fault
I got so scared in here!

20:49.280 --> 20:51.680
Lily, would you mind 
stopping them both, please?

20:51.290 --> 20:53.010
Oh, Maria! Maria!

20:51.680 --> 20:53.010
As you wish.

20:53.010 --> 20:54.440
Listen when I'm talking to you!

20:53.010 --> 20:54.440
I don't care about you!

20:55.240 --> 20:56.890
My dear Lettie.

20:57.460 --> 20:58.820
Your Majesty?

20:59.380 --> 21:01.190
I would like you to have this.

21:02.320 --> 21:03.770
Is it a map?

21:03.770 --> 21:05.140
Yes, of the castle.

21:05.140 --> 21:09.630
I always used to take it with me 
when I escaped from the castle myself.

21:09.630 --> 21:10.910
You did, Your Majesty?

21:11.820 --> 21:14.390
A lady should have her secrets.

21:15.460 --> 21:18.930
Thank you for all you do for my Clarke.

21:21.150 --> 21:22.160
Lettie.

21:23.290 --> 21:24.930
What were you two talking about?

21:25.470 --> 21:26.850
Uh...

21:28.900 --> 21:30.480
It's a secret.

21:35.350 --> 21:38.110
Oh, macarons...

23:19.960 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Time</b>

23:20.090 --> 23:25.090
Clarke has found something he wants

23:20.960 --> 23:25.970
Ah, blessed happiness

23:21.960 --> 23:26.970
All right, Nadir. I won't forget

23:22.960 --> 23:27.970
Leticia, can we go back now?

23:23.970 --> 23:28.970
Huh? Well then why I was summoned?

23:25.970 --> 23:30.970
I brought a present for you today

23:27.340 --> 23:32.350
I'm not the prospective little brother. You're the prospective older brother

23:28.850 --> 23:33.850
Is that an order?

23:30.350 --> 23:35.350
What should we do next?

